# Build context exclusions. Frontend stage 1 needs frontend/src + frontend/package*.json; runtime stage only needs the built static/.
#
# Notes:
# - frontend/ is INTENTIONALLY not excluded — stage 1 of Dockerfile uses it.
# - static/ is INTENTIONALLY not excluded; the multi-stage build copies the
#   freshly-built static/ from --from=frontend, so any host-built static/
#   that sneaks into the build context is harmlessly overwritten in stage 2.
# - tests/ and conftest.py ARE excluded; tests run on the host against the
#   source tree, not inside the production image.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
tests/
conftest.py
*.md
.env
.env.*
node_modules/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
